message: >-
  If you refer to this work, please cite the paper. When the exact bytes of
  the verification artifact matter, also cite the archived Zenodo version.
title: >-
  Generalized DBLog: A Verified Contract for Interleaving Copied Rows with a
  Change Log: paper sources and formal verification artifact
abstract: >-
  Information hub for the paper "Generalized DBLog: A Verified Contract for
  Interleaving Copied Rows with a Change Log." Contains the paper sources as
  posted to arXiv and the complete formal verification artifact (Isabelle/HOL,
  Lean 4, TLA+), byte-identical to its archived Zenodo version 1.0 deposit.
